# Git (MinGit)

On this machine, `git` is not in the shell `PATH`. Use the full path to MinGit:

`c:\Users\user5\Desktop\MinGit\cmd\git.exe`

Example: `& "c:\Users\user5\Desktop\MinGit\cmd\git.exe" status` from the repo root.

For commits and pushes, run `add`, `commit`, and `push` yourself; do not only tell the user to run them unless push fails (e.g. auth) and they must fix credentials locally.
